[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT]
Culanika Lokadhātu

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_desc]
“Truth, as terrible as death, but harder to find.”
Everything is entangled... Narrow Gate, foal’s breath, Tirek, Rain Shine, Winter, Niriks, History...
We’re blind moles. Creeping through the soil, feeling with our snoots. We know nothing. We perceived this... now we don’t know where to go.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT]
千界俱乐部

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_desc]
“真相，像死亡一样可怕，但比死亡更难得到。”
所有的事情都纠缠在一起... 狭关，稚马之息，提雷克，雨晴，寒冬，逆麟，历史...
我们就像是瞎眼的鼹鼠，在土壤中爬行，用我们的鼻子感觉。我们一无所知。我们意识到了这一点... 现在我们已不知该去向何处...
